# key-typed-lookalikes

## Input

```
hello     world
42        value
-57       value
+13       value
true      value
false     value
server.port 8080

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..113
  ENTRY@0..16
    WORD_KEY@0..5
      WORD@0..5 "hello"
    SPACE@5..10 "     "
    LINE_STRING@10..15
      STRING@10..15 "world"
    NEWLINE@15..16 "\n"
  ENTRY@16..32
    WORD_KEY@16..18
      WORD@16..18 "42"
    SPACE@18..26 "        "
    LINE_STRING@26..31
      STRING@26..31 "value"
    NEWLINE@31..32 "\n"
  ENTRY@32..48
    WORD_KEY@32..35
      WORD@32..35 "-57"
    SPACE@35..42 "       "
    LINE_STRING@42..47
      STRING@42..47 "value"
    NEWLINE@47..48 "\n"
  ENTRY@48..64
    WORD_KEY@48..51
      WORD@48..51 "+13"
    SPACE@51..58 "       "
    LINE_STRING@58..63
      STRING@58..63 "value"
    NEWLINE@63..64 "\n"
  ENTRY@64..80
    WORD_KEY@64..68
      WORD@64..68 "true"
    SPACE@68..74 "      "
    LINE_STRING@74..79
      STRING@74..79 "value"
    NEWLINE@79..80 "\n"
  ENTRY@80..96
    WORD_KEY@80..85
      WORD@80..85 "false"
    SPACE@85..90 "     "
    LINE_STRING@90..95
      STRING@90..95 "value"
    NEWLINE@95..96 "\n"
  ENTRY@96..113
    WORD_KEY@96..107
      WORD@96..107 "server.port"
    SPACE@107..108 " "
    INTEGER@108..112
      NUMERAL@108..112 "8080"
    NEWLINE@112..113 "\n"
```

